.TH FL-DESKTOP 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-desktop \- wallpaper and desktop icons
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-desktop\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draws the wallpaper and the files of the XDG desktop folder. Settings are kept in
\fI~/.config/fldesktop/desktop.ini\fR, section [Desktop]: Wallpaper, WallpaperMode
(fill, fit, stretch, center, tile), BackgroundColor and ShowIcons.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
